{"unit_id":"flyhigao__dsh-file-transfer#card-zh","repo":"flyhigao/dsh-file-transfer","commit":"2e9c8ffeea516155995098b0cce3a77e69119216","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-file-transfer 为 DSH Web 的文档预览和工作区文件树添加文件传输操作：预览文件与树中条目可下载，文件夹可打包为 ZIP；文件夹行另有上传入口。下载通过会话级 workspaceFiles Remote 分块读取，上传由 Host 路由流式写入当前会话工作区。操作前显示确认信息，传输显示进度并可取消；上传每文件限 1 GiB，重名自动改名。适合在本地设备与 DSH Web 工作区间收发文件，无需 API Key，上传目录须已存在且可写。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:23-27","client/client.js:895-990","lib/upload-route.js:273-310"]}
{"unit_id":"flyhigao__dsh-file-transfer#card-en","repo":"flyhigao/dsh-file-transfer","commit":"2e9c8ffeea516155995098b0cce3a77e69119216","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-file-transfer adds downloads to DSH Web previews and file trees, plus folder uploads. It reads session files in ranges and can ZIP folders. Uploads stream into the workspace with progress and cancellation. Each upload is capped at 1 GiB; name conflicts are renamed. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:23-27","client/client.js:895-990","lib/upload-route.js:273-310"]}
